Looking at this problem, I need to evaluate:

$$I = \int_{\mathbb{R}^n} \frac{\prod_{k=1}^n \sin(a_k x_k)}{\prod_{k=1}^n x_k} \cdot \frac{\sin\!\bigl(\sum_{k=1}^n a_k x_k\bigr)}{\sum_{k=1}^n a_k x_k}\,dx_1\cdots dx_n$$

**Answer leak check:** The problem statement contains only the integral to evaluate, with no solution, hint, or formalization notes. No leak detected. Proceeding.

